#: kcmkded.cpp:95
msgid "This is a list of available KDE services which will be started on demand. They are only listed for convenience, as you cannot manipulate these services."
msgstr "Disse List wiest de verföögboren Deensten, de start, wenn dat noot deit. Se sünd bloots as Informatschoon oplist, se köönt nich instellt warrn."

